/pr-preview/pr-26/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane-110","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane#modo-interactivo-por-defecto","content":"Dominio Lamassu"},"189":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane-111","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane#modo-interactivo-por-defecto","content":"Usuario y contraseña admin PostgreSQL"},"190":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane-112","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane#modo-interactivo-por-defecto","content":"Usuario y contraseña admin RabbitMQ"},"191":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane-113","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane#modo-interactivo-por-defecto","content":"Usuario y contraseña admin Keycloak"},"192":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane-114","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane#modo-interactivo-por-defecto","content":"Namespace Kubernetes"},"193":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane-115","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane#modo-no-interactivo--n","content":"Se generan credenciales aleatorias de 30 caracteres alfanuméricos."},"194":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane-116","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane#modo-no-interactivo--n","content":"Se usan valores por defecto para dominio y namespace, salvo que se sobrescriban con flags."},"195":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane-117","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane#obtención-de-charts","content":"El script siempre descarga los charts desde repositorios remotos: los charts de PostgreSQL, Keycloak y RabbitMQ desde registros OCI públicos, y el chart de Lamassu desde el repositorio `http://www.lamassu.io/lamassu-helm/` (o desde la ruta local indicada con `-l/--local-chart-path`). No existe modo offline; si el clúster no tiene acceso de red a estos orígenes, usa un despliegue manual del chart con `values.yaml` propio."},"196":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane-118","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane#postgresql-install_postgresql","content":"Chart: `oci://registry-1.docker.io/cloudpirates/postgres`, versión `0.19.5` (imagen PostgreSQL `18.4`)"},"197":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane-119","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane#postgresql-install_postgresql","content":"Release: `postgres`"},"198":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane-120","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane#postgresql-install_postgresql","content":"`fullnameOverride: \"postgresql\"`"},"199":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane-121","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane#postgresql-install_postgresql","content":"El script SQL de inicialización crea las bases de datos `auth` (Keycloak), `pki` (servicios de Lamassu), `authz` (autorización) y `wfx` (workflow), y dentro de la base de datos `pki` crea los esquemas `alerts`, `ca`, `va`, `devicemanager`, `dmsmanager` y `kms`."},"200":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane-122","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane#keycloak-install_keycloak","content":"Chart: `oci://registry-1.docker.io/cloudpirates/keycloak`, versión `0.21.9` (imagen `keycloak/keycloak:26.6.2`)"},"201":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane-123","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane#keycloak-install_keycloak","content":"Release: `auth`, con `service.httpPort: 80`"},"202":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane-124","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane#keycloak-install_keycloak","content":"Uso de base de datos externa: `postgresql:5432/auth`"},"203":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane-125","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane#keycloak-install_keycloak","content":"`httpRelativePath: /auth`"},"204":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane-126","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane#keycloak-install_keycloak","content":"`proxyHeaders: xforwarded`"},"205":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane-127","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane#keycloak-install_keycloak","content":"Variables adicionales: `KC_HOSTNAME_STRICT=false`, `KC_HEALTH_ENABLED=true`, proveedor de lookup de certificados X.509 `envoy` y access log HTTP activado"},"206":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane-128","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane#keycloak-install_keycloak","content":"Configuración automática del realm `lamassu`:"},"207":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane-129","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane#keycloak-install_keycloak","content":"Tema de inicio de sesión: `lamassu-theme-v3` (JAR `lamassu-theme` 3.0.0 descargado por un init container desde `github.com/lamassuiot/keycloak-theme`)"},"208":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane-130","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane#keycloak-install_keycloak","content":"Rol: `pki-admin`"},"209":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane-131","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane#keycloak-install_keycloak","content":"Usuario inicial: `lamassu` / `lamassu` (cambio obligatorio en el primer acceso)"},"210":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane-132","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane#keycloak-install_keycloak","content":"Cliente público: `front