t":"Con `--otel`, antes de Lamassu se despliega una pila de trazas y logs en el mismo namespace:"},"217":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane-139","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane#observabilidad---otel","content":"**VictoriaLogs** (`vm/victoria-logs-single`, release `victoria-logs`) y **VictoriaTraces** (`vm/victoria-traces-single`, release `victoria-traces`), sin volumen persistente."},"218":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane-140","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane#observabilidad---otel","content":"**Jaeger** (`jaegertracing/jaeger`, release `jaeger`) con receptor OTLP y UI en `/infra/jaeger`."},"219":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane-141","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane#observabilidad---otel","content":"**Collector OTel** (`open-telemetry/opentelemetry-collector`, release `otel-collector`) que recibe OTLP de los servicios de Lamassu y envía trazas a Jaeger y a VictoriaTraces."},"220":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane-142","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane#observabilidad---otel","content":"Además, se activa `observability.enabled: true` en el `values` de Lamassu. Las UIs quedan expuestas a través del gateway en las rutas `/infra/logs`, `/infra/traces` y `/infra/jaeger` (ver `observability.routes` en `values.yaml`)."},"221":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane-143","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane#softhsm-y-nethsm---with-hsm","content":"La opción `--with-hsm` configura el KMS de Lamassu para usar PKCS#11. El flujo tiene tres pasos:"},"222":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane-144","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane#softhsm-y-nethsm---with-hsm","content":"**Preparación de credenciales SSH**: el script genera un par de claves SSH ed25519 con `ssh-keygen` y lo usa para el reenvío del socket PKCS#11."},"223":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane-145","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane#softhsm-y-nethsm---with-hsm","content":"**Instalación del chart de SoftHSM**: se despliega el release `hsm` desde la ruta indicada en `--softhsm-chart-path` (por defecto `./charts/softhsm`), con los PIN, slot y token preconfigurados y la clave pública SSH autorizada."},"224":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane-146","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane#softhsm-y-nethsm---with-hsm","content":"**Configuración de Lamassu**: se crea el secret `kms-pkcs11-sidecar-ssh-key` con la clave privada y se fusionan en el `values` de Lamassu tres bloques: `kms.pkcs11Sidecar` (sidecar `p11-kit-ssh-sidecar` que expone el socket PKCS#11 en un volumen compartido), `kms.pkcs11Modules` (init containers que preparan los módulos PKCS#11 en volúmenes compartidos: `p11-kit-client` siempre y `nethsm` solo cuando se despliega NetHSM) y `kms.cryptoEngines` (motor `pkcs11-softhsm` como motor por defecto, `pkcs11-nethsm` si NetHSM está habilitado y `filesystem-1`)."},"225":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane-147","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane#softhsm-y-nethsm---with-hsm","content":"NetHSM solo se despliega si todos los nodos del clúster admiten la arquitectura `amd64` (su imagen no existe para ARM). Antes de instalar, `detect_nethsm_support` consulta la arquitectura de cada nodo con `kubectl get nodes`:"},"226":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane-148","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane#softhsm-y-nethsm---with-hsm","content":"Clúster solo ARM (o sin ningún nodo `amd64`): se omite NetHSM y se despliega solo SoftHSM/PKCS#11."},"227":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane-149","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane#softhsm-y-nethsm---with-hsm","content":"Clúster mixto amd64 + ARM: NetHSM se restringe a los nodos amd64."},"228":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane-150","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane#softhsm-y-nethsm---with-hsm","content":"Arquitectura desconocida o no soportada: el script aborta sin desplegar NetHSM."},"229":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane-151","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane#softhsm-y-nethsm---with-hsm","content":"Para detalles del sidecar PKCS#11 y sus requisitos de Kubernetes, ver SoftHSM como complemento opcional."},"230":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane-152","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane#lamassu-install_lamassu","content":"Se genera un archivo `lamassu.yaml` que se pasa a `helm install`."},"231":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane-153","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane#lamassu-install_lamassu","content":"Configuraciones principales:"},"232":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane-154","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane#lamassu-install_lamassu","content":"PostgreSQL: host `postgresql`, puerto `5432`; las mismas credenciales se reutilizan en `services.authz.credentials` para las bases de datos `pki` y `authz`"},"233":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane-155","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane#lamassu-install_lamassu","content":"AMQP: host `rabbitmq`, puerto `5672`, TLS deshabilitado"},"234":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane-156","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane#lamassu-install_lamassu","content":"CA: motor criptográfico `fs-1` de tipo `filesystem` (`/crypto/fs`); `--with-hsm` no lo modifica, reconfigura el KMS (`services.kms.cryptoEngines`), que pasa a usar PKCS#11 con `pkcs11-softhsm` como motor por defecto (y `pkcs11-nethsm` si se despliega NetHSM), conservando `filesystem-1`"},"235":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane-157","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane#lamassu-install_lamassu