ployment/self-hosted/overview#arquitectura","content":"proveedor OIDC, típicamente Keycloak"},"332":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/deployment/self-hosted/overview-57","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/deployment/self-hosted/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/deployment/self-hosted/overview#arquitectura","content":"El chart no instala estas dependencias por sí solo. Para un despliegue manual hay que provisionarlas antes. Si se busca un entorno funcional rápido para laboratorio o validación, el script Fastlane sí instala PostgreSQL, RabbitMQ y Keycloak además del chart de Lamassu."},"333":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/deployment/self-hosted/overview-58","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/deployment/self-hosted/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/deployment/self-hosted/overview#instalación-manual-con-helm","content":"Agregar el repositorio Helm:"},"334":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/deployment/self-hosted/overview-59","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/deployment/self-hosted/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/deployment/self-hosted/overview#instalación-manual-con-helm","content":"O instalar desde una copia local del repositorio:"},"335":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/deployment/self-hosted/overview-60","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/deployment/self-hosted/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/deployment/self-hosted/overview#valores-mínimos-que-deben-definirse","content":"Los valores por defecto del chart son deliberadamente incompletos para dependencias externas. Como mínimo, un despliegue manual debe definir:"},"336":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/deployment/self-hosted/overview-61","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/deployment/self-hosted/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/deployment/self-hosted/overview#valores-mínimos-que-deben-definirse","content":"`postgres.hostname`, `postgres.username`, `postgres.password`"},"337":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/deployment/self-hosted/overview-62","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/deployment/self-hosted/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/deployment/self-hosted/overview#valores-mínimos-que-deben-definirse","content":"`amqp.hostname`, `amqp.username`, `amqp.password`"},"338":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/deployment/self-hosted/overview-63","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/deployment/self-hosted/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/deployment/self-hosted/overview#valores-mínimos-que-deben-definirse","content":"`auth.oidc.frontend.authority`"},"339":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/deployment/self-hosted/overview-64","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/deployment/self-hosted/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/deployment/self-hosted/overview#valores-mínimos-que-deben-definirse","content":"`auth.oidc.apiGateway.jwks`"},"340":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/deployment/self-hosted/overview-65","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/deployment/self-hosted/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/deployment/self-hosted/overview#valores-mínimos-que-deben-definirse","content":"`services.authz.jwkUrl` y un principal de bootstrap que coincida con un administrador real"},"341":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/deployment/self-hosted/overview-66","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/deployment/self-hosted/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/deployment/self-hosted/overview#valores-mínimos-que-deben-definirse","content":"`services.ca.domains`"},"342":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/deployment/self-hosted/overview-67","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/deployment/self-hosted/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/deployment/self-hosted/overview#valores-mínimos-que-deben-definirse","content":"`gateway.addresses` o una estrategia equivalente de publicación según el clúster"},"343":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/deployment/self-hosted/overview-68","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/deployment/self-hosted/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/deployment/self-hosted/overview#valores-mínimos-que-deben-definirse","content":"`tls.*` según se use `certManager` o certificado externo"},"344":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/deployment/self-hosted/overview-69","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/deployment/self-hosted/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/deployment/self-hosted/overview#valores-mínimos-que-deben-definirse","content":"Ejemplo base:"},"345":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/deployment/self-hosted/overview-70","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/deployment/self-hosted/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/deployment/self-hosted/overview#valores-mínimos-que-deben-definirse","content":"Con `tls.certManagerOptions.issuer` vacío, el chart `4.0.0` crea un `Issuer` self-signed con nombre dependiente del release (por ejemplo, `lamassu-downstream-ca-selfsigned-issuer` con `helm install lamassu`). El valor legado `downstream-ca-selfsigned-issuer` sigue resolviendo al mismo emisor, pero se recomienda dejarlo vacío o apuntar a tu propio `Issuer`/`ClusterIssuer` mediante `tls.certManagerOptions.clusterIssuer`."},"346":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/deployment/self-hosted/overview-71","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/deployment/self-hosted/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/deployment/self-hosted/overview#provisiona-el-primer-administrador","content":"No hay un superusuario implícito. Antes de instalar, crea el rol `pki-admin` en el proveedor OIDC y asígnalo al grupo que administrará Lamassu. El principal del ejemplo concede la política `SUPER ADMIN` a cualquier token que contenga ese rol."},"347":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/deployment/self-hosted/overview-72","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/deployment/self-hosted/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/deployment/self-hosted/overview#provisiona-el-primer-administrador","content":"El Job `pre-install` y `pre-upgrade` prepara las bases de datos, ejecuta las migraciones de authz, precarga las políticas y aplica `services.authz.bootstrap` antes de que arranquen los Deployments. El bootstrap es idempotente: conserva los principales existentes y añade únicamente los grants que falten."},"348":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/deployment/self-hosted/overview-73","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/deployment/self-hosted/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/deployment/self-hosted/overview#provisiona-el-primer-administrador","content":"Si ningún token coincide con un principal activo, nadie podrá administrar la PKI. Prueba una identidad autorizada y otra denegada, y conserva un procedimiento de recuperación."},"349":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/deployment/self-hosted/overview-74","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/deployment/self-hosted/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/deployment/self-hosted/overview#provisiona-el-primer-administrador","content":"Consulta Control de acceso para diseñar principales y políticas."},"350":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/deployment/self-hosted/overview-75","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/deployment/self-hosted/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/deployment/self-hosted/overview#áreas-de-configuración-más-relevantes","content":"**TLS:** `tls.type`, `tls.certManagerOptions.*` y `tls.externalOptions.secretName` controlan el certificado *downstream* del Gateway."},"351":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/deployment/self-hosted/overview-76","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/deployment/self-hosted/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/deployment/self-hosted/overview#áreas-de-configuración-más-relevantes","content":"**Gateway:** `gateway.addresses`, `gateway.ports.*`, `gateway.className` y `gateway.extraRouting` publican la UI y las APIs mediante Envoy Gateway. `gateway.responseOverride` reescribe las respuestas `401`/`403` con cuerpos JSON propios (habilitado por defecto)."},"352":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/deployment/self-hosted/overview-77","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/deployment/self-hosted/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/deployment/self-hosted/overview#áreas-de-configuración-más-relevantes","content":"**Persistencia:** `postgres.*` define la conexión a PostgreSQL."},"353":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/deployment/self-hosted/overview-78","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/deployment/self-hosted/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/deployment/self-hosted/overview#áreas-de-configuración-más-relevantes","content":"**Mensajería:** `amqp.*` configura la conexión a RabbitMQ."},"354":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/deployment/self-hosted/overview-79","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/deployment/self-hosted/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/deployment/self-hosted/overview#áreas-de-configuración-más-relevantes","content":"**Identidad y autorización:** `auth.oidc.*`, `auth.externalAuthorization.*`, `services.authz.jwkUrl` y `services.authz.bootstrap` configuran login, validación JWT, el control de acceso en el Gateway y los permisos iniciales."},"355":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/deployment/self-hosted/overview-80","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/deployment/self-hosted/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/deployment/self-hosted/overview#áreas-de-configuración-más-relevantes","content":"**Autoridades:** `services.ca.domains` establece los dominios autorizados para CA y certificados."},"356":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/deployment/self-hosted/overview-81","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/deployment/self-hosted/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/deployment/self-hosted/overview#áreas-de-configuración-más-relevantes","content":"**Claves:** `services.kms.cryptoEngines.*` configura los motores criptográficos y su almacenamiento."},"357":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/deployment/self-hosted/overview-82","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/deployment/self-hosted/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/deployment/self-hosted/overview#áreas-de-configuración-más-relevantes","content":"**Alertas:** `services.alerts.smtp_server.*` prepara el envío de correo."},"358":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/deployment/self-hosted/overview-83","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/deployment/self-hosted/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/deployment/self-hosted/overview#áreas-de-configuración-más-relevantes","content":"**Observabilidad:** `observability.*` habilita la instrumentación OpenTelemetry (trazas y logs) en todos los servicios."},"359":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/deployment/self-hosted/overview-84","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/deployment/self-hosted/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/deployment/self-hosted/overview#verificación-del-despliegue","content":"El chart incluye una prueba Helm en `charts/lamassu/templates/tests/test-connections.yml`. Tras instalarlo, puede validarse con:"},"360":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/deployment/self-hosted/overview-85","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/deployment/self-hosted/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/deployment/self-hosted/overview#verificación-del-despliegue","content":"La prueba lanza un pod efímero llamado `<release>-connectivity-test` (imagen configurable con `connectivityTest.image`) que comprueba el endpoint `/health` de `ca`, `dms-manager`, `device-manager` y `va`, y que la respuesta del servicio `ui` contiene el título `LamassuIoT Certificate Manager`."},"361":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/deployment/self-hosted/overview-86","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/deployment/self-hosted/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/deployment/self-hosted/overview#repositorio-helm","content":"El repositorio `lamassu-helm` está organizado en tres bloques principales:"},"362":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/deployment/self-hosted/overview-87","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/deployment/self-hosted/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/deployment/self-hosted/overview#repositorio-helm","content":"`charts/lamassu`: chart principal de Lamassu"},"363":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/deployment/self-hosted/overview-88","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/deployment/self-hosted/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/deployment/self-hosted/overview#repositorio-helm","content":"`charts/softhsm`: chart opcional para laboratorios o escenarios de integración con PKCS#11 emulado"},"364":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/deployment/self-hosted/overview-89","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/deployment/self-hosted/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/deployment/self-hosted/overview#repositorio-helm","content":"`scripts/lamassu-fast-lane.sh`: automatización para levantar dependencias y desplegar Lamassu con intervención mínima"},"365":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/deployment/self-hosted/overview-90","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/deployment/self-hosted/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/deployment/self-hosted/overview#softhsm-como-complemento-opcional","content":"El chart `charts/softhsm` no forma parte del despliegue estándar, pero resulta útil en entornos de laboratorio cuando se necesita simular un HSM compatible con PKCS#11. No sustituye a un HSM real en producción; sirve como soporte para pruebas o integraciones concretas."},"366":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/deployment/self-hosted/overview-91","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/deployment/self-hosted/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/deployment/self-hosted/overview#softhsm-como-complemento-opcional","content":"En la versión `4.0.0` del chart, el servicio KMS puede consumir ese token PKCS#11 mediante el sidecar `services.kms.pkcs11Sidecar`, que expone el socket PKCS#11 en un volumen compartido del pod (requiere Kubernetes `1.29+`). El script Fastlane automatiza la integración completa con `--with-hsm` (ver Fastlane)."},"367":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/deployment/self-hosted/overview-92","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/deployment/self-hosted/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/deployment/self-hosted/overview#actualizar-desde-38x","content":"La versión `4.0.0` del chart introduce cambios que rompen la compatibilidad con los despliegues `3.8.x`. La guía completa está en `charts/lamassu/CHANGELOG/3.8.0->4.0.0.md` del repositorio `lamassu-helm`. Los puntos que más afectan a un despliegue manual:"},"368":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/deployment/self-hosted/overview-93","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/deployment/self-hosted/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/deployment/self-hosted/overview#actualizar-desde-38x","content":"**Nombres dependientes del release:** los recursos del chart pasan a llamarse `<release>-<componente>` (por ejemplo, `lamassu-kms`) en lugar de usar nombres fijos. Los PVC de KMS y VA cambian de nombre; si usas motores KMS con almacenamiento en sistema de ficheros o el `fileStore` local de VA, los datos requieren una migración manual descrita en la guía del CHANGELOG: tras `helm upgrade`, los StatefulSets nuevos arrancan con PVC vacíos y hay que copiar el contenido con un pod de ayuda (`alpine:3.20`) ajustando la propiedad a `65532:65532`. Si es una instalación nueva o no usas esos backends, no hay nada que migrar."},"369":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/deployment/self-hosted/overview-94","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/deployment/self-hosted/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/deployment/self-hosted/overview#actualizar-desde-38x","content":"**`services.authz` es obligatorio:** el nuevo servicio de autorización no existía en `3.8.0`. El Job de migraciones crea sus esquemas y precarga políticas, pero no crea la base de datos `pki`; provisiona esa base de datos y concede acceso al usuario de Lamassu antes de actualizar."},"370":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/deployment/self-hosted/overview-95","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/deployment/self-hosted/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/deployment/self-hosted/overview#actualizar-desde-38x","content":"**Validación estricta de valores:** el chart incorpora `values.schema.json` y rechaza claves de nivel superior desconocidas. Elimina bloques obsoletos (por ejemplo, `toolbox`) antes de ejecutar `helm upgrade`."},"371":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/deployment/self-hosted/overview-96","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/deployment/self-hosted/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/deployment/self-hosted/overview#actualizar-desde-38x","content":"**`services.connectors` ahora es un mapa:** cada entrada se indexa por el identificador del conector y debe definir `type` e `image`."},"372":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/deployment/self-hosted/overview-97","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/deployment/self-hosted/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/deployment/self-hosted/overview#actualizar-desde-38x","content":"**Por defecto más seguros:** los pods pasan a ejecutarse como usuario no root `65532:65532`, sin montaje del token del service account, con seccomp `RuntimeDefault` y capacidades eliminadas. Las sobrecargas por servicio de `runAsUser`/`runAsGroup` se han eliminado."},"373":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/deployment/self-hosted/overview-98","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/deployment/self-hosted/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/deployment/self-hosted/overview#actualizar-desde-38x","content":"**`toolbox` pasa a `connectivityTest`:** el contenedor auxiliar de verificación de conectividad se configura en `connectivityTest.image`."},"374":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/deployment/self-hosted/overview-99","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/deployment/self-hosted/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/deployment/self-hosted/overview#versionado-y-migraciones","content":"La versión actual del chart en el repositorio es `4.0.0`. Para upgrades entre versiones, consulta las guías de `charts/lamassu/CHANGELOG/` y revisa especialmente las migraciones de base de datos y el bootstrap de authz."},"375":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/access-control","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/access-control","type":"page","content":"Control de acceso","breadcrumbs":["Docs","Plataforma","Administrar Lamassu"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/access-control"},"376":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/access-control-0","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/access-control","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/access-control","content":"Conecta una identidad OIDC o X.509 con principales, políticas y permisos de Lamassu."},"377":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/access-control-1","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/access-control","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/access-control#cómo-se-toma-una-decisión","content":"Cómo se toma una decisión"},"378":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/access-control-2","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/access-control","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/access-control#principales","content":"Principales"},"379":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/access-control-3","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/access-control","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/access-control#políticas","content":"Políticas"},"380":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/access-control-4","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/access-control","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/access-control#provisiona-el-primer-administrador","content":"Provisiona el primer administrador"},"381":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/access-control-5","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/access-control","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/access-control#bootstrap-de-fastlane","content":"Bootstrap de Fastlane"},"382":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/access-control-6","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/access-control","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/access-control#operación-segura","content":"Operación segura"},"383":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/access-control-7","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/access-control","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/access-control#diagnóstico-rápido","content":"Diagnóstico rápido"},"384":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/access-control-8","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/access-control","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/access-control","content":"Lamassu separa autenticación y autorización. El proveedor OIDC o el certificado cliente demuestra quién realiza la petición; el servicio authz relaciona esa identidad con uno o varios principales y decide qué acciones están permitidas."},"385":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/access-control-9","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/access-control","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/access-control#cómo-se-toma-una-decisión","content":"El Gateway valida la autenticación configurada, normalmente un JWT mediante JWKS."},"386":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/access-control-10","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/access-control","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/access-control#cómo-se-toma-una-decisión","content":"Envoy envía la petición al endpoint de autorización externa /v1/ext\\_authz/check."},"387":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/access-control-11","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/access-control","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/access-control#cómo-se-toma-una-decisión","content":"authz compara las credenciales con principales activos."},"388":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/access-control-12","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/access-control","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/access-control#cómo-se-toma-una-decisión","content":"Reúne las políticas concedidas a los principales coincidentes."},"389":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/access-control-13","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/access-control","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/access-control#cómo-se-toma-una-decisión","content":"Evalúa la acción HTTP o el recurso solicitado y permite o deniega."},"390":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/access-control-14","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/access-control","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/access-control#cómo-se-toma-una-decisión","content":"Por defecto, auth.externalAuthorization.failOpen es false. Si authz no responde, el Gateway bloquea la petición protegida."},"391":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/access-control-15","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/access-control","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/access-control#principales","content":"Un principal representa una identidad autorizable, no necesariamente una persona individual. Tiene un identificador estable, nombre, tipo, configuración de coincidencia, estado activo y políticas concedidas."},"392":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/access-control-16","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/access-control","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/access-control#principales","content":"Lamassu admite dos tipos:"},"393":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/access-control-17","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/access-control","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/access-control#principales","content":"**oidc**: coincide con claims de un token, por ejemplo un rol, grupo o preferred\\_username."},"394":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/access-control-18","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/access-control","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/access-control#principales","content":"**x509**: coincide con una identidad autenticada mediante certificado y su configuración de confianza."},"395":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/access-control-19","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/access-control","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/access-control#principales","content":"Diseña los principales alrededor de identidades estables del proveedor. Para administración humana suele ser preferible un grupo o rol gestionado centralmente; para automatización, usa una identidad técnica independiente."},"396":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/access-control-20","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/access-control","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/access-control#políticas","content":"Una política agrupa reglas reutilizables. Las reglas pueden:"},"397":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/access-control-21","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/access-control","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/access-control#políticas","content":"permitir acciones sobre un tipo de entidad;"},"398":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/access-control-22","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/access-control","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/access-control#políticas","content":"limitar el acceso a identificadores concretos;"},"399":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/access-control-23","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/access-control","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/access-control#políticas","content":"seguir relaciones entre entidades;"},"400":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/access-control-24","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/access-control","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/access-control#políticas","content":"aplicar filtros por atributos;"},"401":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/access-control-25","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/access-control","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/access-control#políticas","content":"conceder acciones HTTP lógicas definidas por el esquema de una API."},"402":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/access-control-26","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/access-control","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/access-control#políticas","content":"La acción \\* en una regla HTTP concede todas las acciones definidas por ese esquema. Resérvala para roles administrativos controlados."},"403":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/access-control-27","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/access-control","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/access-control#provisiona-el-primer-administrador","content":"Una instalación sin un principal que coincida con tu identidad queda sin nadie capaz de administrar la PKI. Define el bootstrap y configura el IdP antes de exponer la plataforma."},"404":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/access-control-28","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/access-control","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/access-control#provisiona-el-primer-administrador","content":"El chart crea por defecto un principal que busca el rol OIDC pki-admin en realm\\_access.roles y le concede las políticas de administración incluidas. El Job Helm de preinstalación y preactualización ejecuta las migraciones de authz, precarga las políticas y crea los principales de bootstrap antes de iniciar los servicios."},"405":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/access-control-29","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/access-control","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/access-control#provisiona-el-primer-administrador","content":"Antes de instalar:"},"406":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/access-control-30","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/access-control","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/access-control#provisiona-el-primer-administrador","content":"Crea el rol pki-admin en tu proveedor OIDC."},"407":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/access-control-31","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/access-control","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/access-control#provisiona-el-primer-administrador","content":"Asígnalo a un grupo administrativo pequeño y verificable."},"408":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/access-control-32","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/access-control","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/access-control#provisiona-el-primer-administrador","content":"Configura la URL JWKS interna que alcanzará authz."},"409":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/access-control-33","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/access-control","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/access-control#provisiona-el-primer-administrador","content":"Mantén al menos dos identidades humanas de recuperación."},"410":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/access-control-34","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/access-control","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/access-control#provisiona-el-primer-administrador","content":"Prueba acceso permitido y denegado con usuarios distintos."},"411":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/access-control-35","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/access-control","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/access-control#provisiona-el-primer-administrador","content":"El bootstrap es idempotente: si el principal ya existe, no lo reemplaza; solo añade las políticas configuradas que todavía falten. Por eso puedes mantenerlo en values.yaml durante las actualizaciones."},"412":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/access-control-36","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/access-control","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/access-control#bootstrap-de-fastlane","content":"Fastlane instala un realm de Keycloak para laboratorio y crea el usuario lamassu con contraseña temporal lamassu, rol pki-admin y acción obligatoria de cambio de contraseña. Su principal de bootstrap coincide por preferred\\_username=lamassu."},"413":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/access-control-37","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/access-control","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/access-control#bootstrap-de-fastlane","content":"Cambia la contraseña en el primer acceso. No reutilices este usuario ni el IdP de ejemplo como diseño de producción."},"414":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/access-control-38","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/access-control","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/access-control#operación-segura","content":"Concede políticas a grupos o identidades técnicas, no a claims ambiguos."},"415":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/access-control-39","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/access-control","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/access-control#operación-segura","content":"Desactiva un principal cuando deba perder acceso de inmediato."},"416":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/access-control-40","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/access-control","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/access-control#operación-segura","content":"Separa administración de PKI, operación de dispositivos y automatizaciones."},"417":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/access-control-41","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/access-control","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/access-control#operación-segura","content":"Revisa los grants tras cambios en el proveedor OIDC."},"418":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/access-control-42","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/access-control","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/access-control#operación-segura","content":"Mantén failOpen: false salvo una decisión de riesgo explícita."},"419":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/access-control-43","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/access-control","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/access-control#operación-segura","content":"Conserva un procedimiento probado para recuperar acceso sin desactivar autorización."},"420":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/access-control-44","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/access-control","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/access-control#diagnóstico-rápido","content":"Un 401 suele indicar que el Gateway no pudo validar la autenticación. Revisa emisor, audiencia, expiración y JWKS."},"421":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/access-control-45","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/access-control","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/access-control#diagnóstico-rápido","content":"Un 403 indica normalmente que la identidad se autenticó, pero ningún principal activo y sus políticas autorizaron la acción. Comprueba claims reales del token, regla de coincidencia, grants y acción solicitada."},"422":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/access-control-46","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/access-control","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/access-control#diagnóstico-rápido","content":"Si todas las rutas protegidas fallan, verifica la salud y conectividad de authz, su acceso a PostgreSQL y la URL JWKS. Continúa con Resolución de problemas."},"423":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/alerts","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/alerts","type":"page","content":"Alertas y suscripciones","breadcrumbs":["Docs","Plataforma","Operar Lamassu"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/alerts"},"424":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/alerts-0","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/alerts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/alerts","content":"Envía eventos de la PKI a personas y sistemas externos."},"425":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/alerts-1","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/alerts","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/alerts#cómo-funciona","content":"Cómo funciona"},"426":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/alerts-2","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/alerts","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/alerts#canales-disponibles","content":"Canales disponibles"},"427":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/alerts-3","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/alerts","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/alerts#crea-una-suscripción","content":"Crea una suscripción"},"428":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/alerts-4","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/alerts","type":"head