device-management#estados-del-dispositivo","content":"**Active** indica que el dispositivo tiene una identidad válida."},"957":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/device-management-14","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/device-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/device-management#estados-del-dispositivo","content":"**No Identity** aparece cuando está registrado, pero todavía no tiene un certificado asociado."},"958":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/device-management-15","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/device-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/device-management#estados-del-dispositivo","content":"**Renewal Pending** señala que ha entrado en la ventana de renovación."},"959":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/device-management-16","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/device-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/device-management#estados-del-dispositivo","content":"**Expiring Soon** advierte que el certificado está próximo a expirar."},"960":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/device-management-17","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/device-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/device-management#estados-del-dispositivo","content":"**Expired** indica que la identidad ha superado su fecha de validez."},"961":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/device-management-18","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/device-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/device-management#estados-del-dispositivo","content":"**Revoked** identifica un certificado invalidado antes de su expiración."},"962":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/device-management-19","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/device-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/device-management#estados-del-dispositivo","content":"**Decommissioned** corresponde a un dispositivo retirado de forma permanente."},"963":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/device-management-20","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/device-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/device-management#estados-del-dispositivo","content":"El inventario permite filtrar por `Device ID`, etiquetas y estado."},"964":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/device-management-21","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/device-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/device-management#inspecciona-un-dispositivo","content":"La vista de detalle separa dos perspectivas:"},"965":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/device-management-22","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/device-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/device-management#inspecciona-un-dispositivo","content":"**Certificate History** conserva todos los certificados asociados, con su número de serie, emisor, estado y periodo de validez."},"966":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/device-management-23","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/device-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/device-management#inspecciona-un-dispositivo","content":"**Device Event Timeline** ordena cronológicamente registros, enrolamientos, renovaciones y cambios de estado."},"967":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/device-management-24","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/device-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/device-management#inspecciona-un-dispositivo","content":"Utiliza el historial para auditoría y la línea de tiempo para reconstruir un incidente o diagnosticar una transición inesperada."},"968":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/device-management-25","