-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/troubleshooting#el-enrolamiento-est-falla","content":"El enrolamiento EST falla"},"1692":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/troubleshooting-13","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/troubleshooting","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/troubleshooting#ocsp-o-crl-no-reflejan-un-cambio","content":"OCSP o CRL no reflejan un cambio"},"1693":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/troubleshooting-14","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/troubleshooting","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/troubleshooting#los-eventos-no-llegan","content":"Los eventos no llegan"},"1694":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/troubleshooting-15","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/troubleshooting","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/troubleshooting#observabilidad","content":"Observabilidad"},"1695":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/troubleshooting-16","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/troubleshooting","content":"Empieza por localizar la capa que falla. Una respuesta del Gateway, un pod no preparado y una emisión rechazada pueden parecer el mismo problema desde la consola, pero requieren evidencias distintas."},"1696":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/troubleshooting-17","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/troubleshooting#reproduce-una-sola-operación","content":"Anota hora en UTC, usuario o principal, recurso, endpoint y resultado. Evita repetir una acción destructiva como revocación o eliminación."},"1697":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/troubleshooting-18","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/troubleshooting#separa-cliente-gateway-y-servicio","content":"Comprueba el código HTTP. Un 401 apunta a autenticación; un 403, a autorización; un 404, a ruta o recurso; un 5xx, al servicio o una dependencia."},"1698":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/troubleshooting-19","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/troubleshooting#revisa-el-estado-de-kubernetes","content":"Localiza pods no preparados, reinicios, eventos recientes y el estado del release."},"1699":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/troubleshooting-20","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/troubleshooting#consulta-el-servicio-afectado","content":"Revisa su endpoint /health y sus logs en la misma ventana temporal. Después sigue la dependencia indicada: PostgreSQL, RabbitMQ, proveedor OIDC o motor criptográfico."},"1700":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/troubleshooting-21","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/troubleshooting#valida-el-resultado-desde-fuera","content":"Para PKI, comprueba el certificado, la cadena, OCSP o CRL con el mismo tipo de cliente que utiliza producción."},"1701":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/troubleshooting-22","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/troubleshooting#recogida-mínima-de-evidencias","content":"Sustituye los marcadores por tu release, namespace y deployment reales."},"1702":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/troubleshooting-23","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/troubleshooting#recogida-mínima-de-evidencias","content":"Ejecuta también la prueba de conectividad del chart:"},"1703":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/troubleshooting-24","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/troubleshooting#recogida-mínima-de-evidencias","content":"El test consulta la salud de CA, DMS Manager, Device Manager y VA, y comprueba que la UI devuelve HTML. Un test correcto confirma conectividad básica, no un flujo completo de emisión."},"1704":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/troubleshooting-25","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/troubleshooting#recogida-mínima-de-evidencias","content":"Los servicios del chart exponen sondas de inicio, disponibilidad y vida sobre /health. Un pod puede estar ejecutándose pero no recibir tráfico si la readiness probe falla."},"1705":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/troubleshooting-26","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/troubleshooting#no-puedo-iniciar-sesión","content":"Si recibes un 401:"},"1706":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/troubleshooting-27","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/troubleshooting#no-puedo-iniciar-sesión","content":"comprueba que la autoridad OIDC de la UI sea accesible desde el navegador;"},"1707":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/troubleshooting-28","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/troubleshooting#no-puedo-iniciar-sesión","content":"verifica emisor, audiencia y expiración del token;"},"1708":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/troubleshooting-29","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/troubleshooting#no-puedo-iniciar-sesión","content":"confirma que el Gateway puede obtener las claves de la URI JWKS;"},"1709":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/troubleshooting-30","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/troubleshooting#no-puedo-iniciar-sesión","content":"revisa que la ruta pública e interna del proveedor apunten al mismo realm."},"1710":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/troubleshooting-31","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/troubleshooting#no-puedo-iniciar-sesión","content":"Si el login termina pero las APIs devuelven 403:"},"1711":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/troubleshooting-32","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/troubleshooting#no-puedo-iniciar-sesión","content":"inspecciona los claims reales del token;"},"1712":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/troubleshooting-33","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/troubleshooting#no-puedo-iniciar-sesión","content":"confirma que coinciden con un principal activo;"},"1713":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/troubleshooting-34","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/troubleshooting#no-puedo-iniciar-sesión","content":"revisa las políticas concedidas al principal;"},"1714":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/troubleshooting-35","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/troubleshooting#no-puedo-iniciar-sesión","content":"verifica que authz alcanza PostgreSQL y su JWKS."},"1715":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/troubleshooting-36","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/troubleshooting#no-puedo-iniciar-sesión","content":"En una instalación nueva, confirma que el Job de migración terminó. Ese Job crea esquemas, migra authz, precarga políticas y provisiona los principales definidos en services.authz.bootstrap."},"1716":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/troubleshooting-37","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/troubleshooting#todo-devuelve-403-o-5xx","content":"La autorización externa falla cerrada por defecto. Si authz no está disponible, las rutas protegidas se bloquean."},"1717":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/troubleshooting-38","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/troubleshooting#todo-devuelve-403-o-5xx","content":"Localiza el pod y Service de authz."},"1718":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/troubleshooting-39","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/troubleshooting#todo-devuelve-403-o-5xx","content":"Comprueba /health, logs y conexión a su base de datos."},"1719":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/troubleshooting-40","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/troubleshooting#todo-devuelve-403-o-5xx","content":"Verifica el DNS y puerto configurados en externalAuthorization."},"1720":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/troubleshooting-41","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/troubleshooting#todo-devuelve-403-o-5xx","content":"Comprueba que la ruta del check es /v1/ext\\_authz/check."},"1721":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/troubleshooting-42","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/troubleshooting#todo-devuelve-403-o-5xx","content":"No cambies a failOpen: true como solución permanente: permitiría tráfico sin autorización durante la caída."},"1722":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/troubleshooting-43","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/troubleshooting#un-pod-no-está-ready","content":"Revisa primero kubectl describe pod. Las causas habituales son:"},"1723":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/troubleshooting-44","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/troubleshooting#un-pod-no-está-ready","content":"credenciales o DNS incorrectos para PostgreSQL o RabbitMQ;"},"1724":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/troubleshooting-45","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/troubleshooting#un-pod-no-está-ready","content":"volumen persistente sin enlazar;"},"1725":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/troubleshooting-46","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/troubleshooting#un-pod-no-está-ready","content":"imagen inaccesible o política de pull incorrecta;"},"1726":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/troubleshooting-47","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/troubleshooting#un-pod-no-está-ready","content":"configuración inválida del motor criptográfico;"},"1727":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/troubleshooting-48","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-26/platform/pki/troubleshooting","tags":[